<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <!-- 語言版本、分析器、可重現建置與共用套件中繼資料集中在 repo 根目錄的 Directory.Build.props -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <!-- 目標框架：語法以 netstandard2.0 可用為準 -->
    <TargetFrameworks>netstandard2.0;netstandard2.1;net8.0;net9.0;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>

    <!-- 套件基本資訊 -->
    <PackageId>Ozakboy.Gmail</PackageId>
    <AssemblyName>Ozakboy.Gmail</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>Ozakboy.Gmail</RootNamespace>
    <Title>Ozakboy.Gmail — Thin async Gmail REST client + Google OAuth for .NET</Title>
    <Product>Ozakboy.Gmail</Product>
    <Description>A thin, async-only client for the Gmail REST API and the Google OAuth 2.0 token endpoints, with no dependency on Google.Apis. List, read and send messages (via messages.send, so the single gmail.modify scope is enough), incremental sync with history.list, labels, trash, attachments, plus authorization URL building, code exchange, token refresh and revocation. You supply an access-token provider; the library never stores tokens. Every non-2xx response becomes a GmailApiException with the Google error reason and flags for expired history, revoked authorization and rate limiting; 429 / 5xx are retried with exponential backoff. No third-party MIME library: outgoing mail is composed by a built-in RFC 822 writer (GmailOutgoingMessage) or supplied as raw RFC 822 bytes. Targets netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0.</Description>
    <PackageTags>gmail;gmail-api;google;oauth;oauth2;google-oauth;email;mail;rest;async;rfc822;mime;history;labels;dotnet;csharp;netstandard</PackageTags>

    <!-- 版本資訊 -->
    <Version>2.1.0</Version>
    <PackageVersion>2.1.0</PackageVersion>
    <AssemblyVersion>2.1.0.0</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>2.1.0.0</FileVersion>

    <!-- 專案連結 -->
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/ozakboy.Gmail</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/ozakboy.Gmail</RepositoryUrl>

    <!-- 建置產出 -->
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>True</GenerateDocumentationFile>

    <PackageReleaseNotes>
v2.1.0 — faster backfill, thread endpoints, body / attachment helpers, a ready-made access-token provider, and finer retry control. No breaking changes.

ADDED:
- BatchGetMessagesAsync(ids, format, metadataHeaders) — fetches many messages through the Gmail batch endpoint (multipart/mixed, up to GmailClientOptions.BatchSize = 50 per HTTP request, chunked automatically). Returns GmailBatchGetResult with Messages and per-id Failures (deleted messages, per-item rate limits) instead of failing the whole batch.
- Thread endpoints: GetThreadAsync, ModifyThreadAsync, TrashThreadAsync, UntrashThreadAsync, with the GmailThread model.
- GmailMessage.GetTextBody() / GetHtmlBody() — walk the MIME parts Gmail already split and return the decoded body; GmailMessage.GetAttachments() — every attachment part as GmailAttachmentInfo (part id, file name, MIME type, size, attachment id, Content-ID).
- GoogleAccessTokenProvider — caches the access token, refreshes it ahead of expiry (RefreshSkew, default 2 minutes), serialises concurrent refreshes, and reports each refresh through OnRefreshed so you can persist it. Pass provider.GetAccessTokenAsync to GmailClient.
- GmailApiException.RetryAfter — the Retry-After value of the final failed response, for job-level backoff.
- GmailClientOptions.MaxRetryDelay (default 60 s) — a Retry-After longer than this is not waited for; the exception is thrown immediately with RetryAfter set. GmailClientOptions.RetryOnNetworkErrors (default false) — retry HttpRequestException with the same backoff.

FIXED:
- On .NET Framework, a 204 No Content response (batchModify, labels.delete, revoke) threw NullReferenceException because HttpResponseMessage.Content can be null there. Found by the new net48 test target.

TECHNICAL:
- The test project now also targets net48 and runs every test against the netstandard2.0 build.

Full changelog: https://github.com/ozakboy/ozakboy.Gmail/blob/main/docs/en/changelog.md
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!-- 打包到 NuGet 的門面檔案（README 為英文版） -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="True" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\README_zh-TW.md" />
    <None Include="..\..\LICENSE" Pack="True" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\logo.png" Pack="True" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!--
    NuGet 相依套件:只允許 .NET BCL 與 Microsoft 官方套件,判定看遞移相依。
    Microsoft.Extensions.* 10.x 仍支援 netstandard2.0 / net462,所以五個目標框架不必分開處理。
    Dependencies: BCL and first-party Microsoft packages only, judged by the transitive graph.
    Microsoft.Extensions.* 10.x still targets netstandard2.0 / net462, so one version serves all five TFMs.
  -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Abstractions" Version="10.0.12" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Binder" Version="10.0.12" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!-- System.Text.Json 在 netstandard 不是內建，需套件；net8.0+ 走內建版本 -->
  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'netstandard2.0' Or '$(TargetFramework)' == 'netstandard2.1'">
    <PackageReference Include="System.Text.Json" Version="10.0.12" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!--
    刻意不引用 Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub 套件,與其他 Ozakboy.* 套件一致。
    自 .NET 8 起 SourceLink 已內建於 SDK,設定 PublishRepositoryUrl 與 EmbedUntrackedSources
    (見 Directory.Build.props)即可;外掛套件反而會遞移帶進有安全通報的 Microsoft.Build.Tasks.Git
    (GHSA-23fw-v26w-5fgq),在 TreatWarningsAsErrors 之下讓「還原」階段就直接失敗。
    Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub is deliberately not referenced: SourceLink ships in the SDK since .NET 8, and the
    plugin transitively pulls in Microsoft.Build.Tasks.Git, which carries a published advisory.
  -->

  <!-- 測試專案需存取 Ozakboy.Gmail.Core 的內部型別 -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <AssemblyAttribute Include="System.Runtime.CompilerServices.InternalsVisibleToAttribute">
      <_Parameter1>Ozakboy.Gmail.Tests</_Parameter1>
    </AssemblyAttribute>
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
